      "html_url": "https://acme.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/5001-Reset-your-password",
      "body": "<h2>Before you start</h2><p>You need access to your <strong>sign-in e-mail</strong>. If you changed it, read <a href=\"/hc/en-us/articles/5002-Change-your-email\">Change your email</a> first.</p><p><img src=\"https://acme.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/360001/reset-form.png\" alt=\"The reset form\"></p><ol><li>Open <em>Sign in</em>.</li><li>Choose <code>Forgot password</code>.</li></ol><table><thead><tr><th>Plan</th><th>Reset time</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Free</td><td>10 minutes</td></tr></tbody></table><script>track()</script>"
    },
    {
