      "body": "<p>Open <em>Profile</em> and edit the address.</p><p><img src=\"https://files.example.org/screens/profile.png\" alt=\"Profile\"></p><p>Back to <a href=\"https://acme.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/5001\">resetting a password</a> or <a href=\"https://example.org/policy\">our policy</a>.</p>"
